DDIIAAGGNNOOSSTTIICCSS
       Problems  are  logged to the standard error stream and to ssyyssllooggdd(8) or
       ppoossttllooggdd(8).  No output means that no problems were detected. Duplicate
       entries are skipped and are flagged with a warning.

       ppoossttmmaapp(1) terminates with zero exit status in case of success (includ‐
       ing successful "ppoossttmmaapp --qq" lookup) and terminates with  non-zero  exit
       status in case of failure.

